li\"></span> This overload participates in overload resolution only if all following values are <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>:\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_swappable\"><span class=\"kw576\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_swappable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_swappable\"><span class=\"kw576\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_swappable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>E<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw546\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_move_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw546\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_move_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>E<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw550\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">||</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_constructible\"><span class=\"kw550\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_constructible_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>E<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The unexpected values are swapped as follows:\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Value of<br>&nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/expe